   credits Herdr's shipped mods and herdr-quota by Lakris2407 (MIT), is in
   licenses/agent-workspace-NOTICE; its license in
   licenses/agent-workspace-LICENSE.txt; its Lucide icons' license in
   licenses/lucide-LICENSE.txt.
     mods/sw84-workspace-chrome   from mods/workspace-chrome-tr
     mods/sw84-tabs               from mods/tabs-tr
     mods/sw84-agents             from mods/agents-tr
     mods/sw84-task-presets       from mods/task-presets-tr
     mods/sw84-menu               from mods/menu-tr
