3. herdr-space-folders by Jankees van Woezik (MIT License;
   https://github.com/jankeesvw/herdr-space-folders), license in
   licenses/space-folders-LICENSE.txt. It is a clone of Herdr's shipped
   "spaces" mod (Apache License, Version 2.0; https://herdr.dev).
     mods/sw84-space-folders      from mods/space-folders

Changes: renamed to sw84-*; English-only interface (Turkish removed); Android
and team-pulse parts removed; window buttons at the top left; colours taken
from the theme instead of fixed values; task presets read from
~/.agents/tasks.json; quota lists only signed-in providers; the agents list
shows what each agent works on and groups agents by machine. Each modified main.js starts with a notice naming
its original.

mods/sw84-space-folders keeps the folders file ~/.config/herdr-space-folders.json
and mods/sw84-quota the shared quota state under their original names, so an
installed space-folders or quota mod sees the same folders and readings.

mods/synthwave-84/fonts carries DejaVu Sans Mono (Bitstream Vera license,
mods/synthwave-84/fonts/LICENSE.txt).
